# Added by code-review-graph
.code-review-graph/

# Other agents' local configuration.
#
# Several tools write their own setup into this repo — directories, dotfiles,
# and (against this project's own rule) markdown at the root. None of it is
# mogeung's, none of it should travel with a clone, and the three root .md
# files are what `check-docs` was failing on: the rule is about the tree, so
# ignoring them is what actually makes the check honest rather than silenced.
# They stay on disk; they just stop being the repo's business.
.claude/
.codebuddy/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.github/
.kiro/
.qoder/
.vscode/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.mcp.json
opencode.jsonc
CODEBUDDY.md
GEMINI.md
QODER.md

# Browser-automation output, written when the app is driven for a check.
.playwright-mcp/
